help Webrtc
janus info - Show Janus server information in human-readable form (use 'janus info json' for raw JSON)
janus list - List Janus rooms and sessions (shortcut for diagnostics)
janus list rooms - List the rooms on the Janus server
janus list sessions - List active Janus sessions (admin API)
janus room <roomId> - Show one room with participant details
janus show - Alias for 'janus info'